  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Segment an SEM image of a fiber network with Otsu thresholding, correct dark fiber-center bands wrongly marked as pores by reclassifying regions on shape, and report fiber diameter and void/pore chord-length distributions (d50/p95) that can be exported as CSV or HTML. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
